<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The Android app already works with Retrofit. Now the team wants to share business logic with iOS. Replacing annotations with client calls is the visible part; the harder part is keeping authentication, serialization, cancellation and failure behaviour consistent across platforms. Start by deciding which code needs to be shared.</p>

